"best":[[15,1,313000]],"xl":[],"bx":[],"nar":[{"lap":0,"text":"Of the 35 cars entered, only 28 lined up at the start on Sunday afternoon in front of 40 000 enthusiastic spectators.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Madame Manceron, wife of the Resident Superior of Tunesia, gave the starting signal at 1:00 PM. The field got away in a cloud of smoke and screaming engines.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":1,"text":"After the first lap, Fagioli took the lead, closely chased by Varzi's red Bugatti, then followed Lehoux, Etancelin, von Morgen, Dreyfus, Klinger and Biondetti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":1,"text":"Ernesto Maserati passed on first position of his class with a noticeable advantage to Veyron.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":1,"text":"Jacquin parked his Amilcar with a stripped magneto drive, while Marret's Slalmson threw a connecting rod through its crankcase.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":2,"text":"By the end of the second lap Fagioli lost his lead, when Varzi in the faster twin-cam Bugatti passed him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"After three laps Dreyfus passed Lehoux for third place behind Varzi and Fagioli, while Ernesto Maserati gained more ground in his class.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":4,"text":"On the fourth lap Dreyfus stopped for 3m45s at his pit to repair an oil pipe leak and left again in fourth position, behind Varzi, Fagioli and Lehoux.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":4,"text":"Mme Itier's Bugatti seemed to have fuel problems when the engine spat back but she did not stop at her pit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":21},{"lap":10,"text":"on the tenth lap his Maserati left the road at a corner and crashed into a tree, rendering the car useless. Luckily, the driver was not injured.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":10,"text":"With Dreyfus out, Biondetti moved into fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":12,"text":"On lap 12 Fagioli headed for the pits to change spark plugs without losing his position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":14,"text":"On lap 14 Varzi burst a tire and stopped at his pit for new rubber, which enabled Fagioli to take the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Fagioli pits again for plugs; Varzi back in front, Lehoux second.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":16,"text":"Biondetti bursts a tyre; von Morgen and Etancelin get past him.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":18,"text":"Castelbarco's Talbot withdraws with gearbox problems; Eberhardt follows with a broken valve.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":22,"text":"Lehoux and Fagioli fight over second place behind Varzi.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":24,"text":"Varzi stops again with a defective tyre; Lehoux closes up.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"On lap 27 Biondetti pressed his Maserati past von Morgen.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":28,"text":"A shower of stones shatters von Morgen's windshield and goggles; he has to brake and loses time.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":31,"text":"Fagioli overtakes Lehoux.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":34,"text":"Fagioli makes a brief stop.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":36,"text":"Fagioli passes Lehoux again for second.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":37,"text":"Varzi wins; Fagioli second, visibly exhausted; Lehoux third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":37,"text":"Ernesto Maserati easily won the 1500 cc class ahead of Veyron and Scaron.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7}]}